Represent. Theory \u003Cstrong\u003E1\u003C/strong\u003E (1997), 190\u0026ndash;206. \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=1457244\u0022\u003EMR \u003Cstrong\u003E1457244\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/a\u003E, DOI \u003Ca href=\u0022https://doi.org/10.1090/S1088-4165-97-00031-9\u0022\u003E10.1090/S1088-4165-97-00031-9\u003C/a\u003E \u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","BibliographicInfo":"\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDan Barbasch\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EAffiliation: Department of Mathematics, 310 Malott Hall, Cornell University, Ithaca, New York 14853\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EMR Author ID: \u003Ca href=\u0027https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?mrauthid=30950\u0027\u003E30950\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EEmail: barbasch@math.cornell.edu\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJia-Jun Ma\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EAffiliation: School of Mathematical Sciences, Xiamen University, Xiamen 361005, People\u0026rsquo;s Republic of China; and Department of Mathematics, Xiamen University Malaysia Campus, Sepang, Selangor Darul Ehsan 43900, Malaysia\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EMR Author ID: \u003Ca href=\u0027https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?mrauthid=1082964\u0027\u003E1082964\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EORCID: \u003Ca href=\u0027https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1045-639X\u0027\u003E0000-0002-1045-639X\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EEmail: hoxide@xmu.edu.cn\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBinyong Sun\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EAffiliation: Institute for Advanced Study in Mathematics, Zhejiang University, Hangzhou 310058, People\u0026rsquo;s Republic of China; and New Cornerstone Science Laboratory, Zhejiang University, Hangzhou 310058, People\u0026rsquo;s Republic of China\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EMR Author ID: \u003Ca href=\u0027https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?mrauthid=805605\u0027\u003E805605\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EEmail: sunbinyong@zju.edu.cn\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EChen-Bo Zhu\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EAffiliation: Department of Mathematics, National University of Singapore, 10 Lower Kent Ridge Road, Singapore 119076\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EMR Author ID: \u003Ca href=\u0027https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?mrauthid=305157\u0027\u003E305157\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EORCID: \u003Ca href=\u0027https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-1458\u0027\u003E0000-0003-3819-1458\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EEmail: matzhucb@nus.edu.sg\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EReceived by editor(s): May 25, 2023\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EReceived by editor(s) in revised form: May 13, 2026, and May 26, 2026\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EPublished electronically: September 21, 2026\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EAdditional Notes: The first author was supported by the NSF grant, Award Number 2000254. The second author was supported by the National Natural Science Foundation of China (Grant No. 11701364, 11971305 and 12571032), the Fundamental Research Funds for the Central Universities (No. 20720220043 and No. 20720230022), and Xiamen University Malaysia Research Fund (Grant No. XMUMRF/2022-C9/IMAT/0019 and XMUMRF/2025-C15/IMAT/0036). The third author was supported by National Key R \u0026amp; D Program of China No. 2022YFA1005300 and New Cornerstone Science Foundation. The fourth author was supported by MOE AcRF Tier 1 grants A-0004280-00-00 and A-8002490-00-00, and Provost\u2019s Chair grant E-146-00-0018-01 in NUS.\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\u003Cli\u003EDedicated: To Roger E. Howe with gratitude and admiration\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\u003Cli\u003E\u0026copy; Copyright 2026\nAmerican Mathematical Society\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EJournal: J. Amer. Math. Soc.\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EMSC (2020): Primary 22E45, 22E46\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EDOI: https://doi.org/10.1090/jams/1082\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E","PdfUrl":"/0000-000-00/S0894-0347-2026-01082-X/S0894-0347-2026-01082-X.pdf","HtmlUrl":null,"Authors":[{"RelationshipType":"AUTHOR","FullName":"Dan Barbasch","FirstName":"Dan","MiddleName":" ","LastName":"Barbasch","Suffix":" ","MasterCustomerId":"BRDNMK","MRAuthorId":30950,"Email":"barbasch@math.cornell.edu","CustomerSequence":0,"Affiliation":"Department of Mathematics, 310 Malott Hall, Cornell University, Ithaca, New York 14853","AffiliationSequence":0,"FirstEditor":false,"Url":null,"Description":null,"BookReviewId":0,"CurrentAddress":null},{"RelationshipType":"AUTHOR","FullName":"Jia-Jun Ma","FirstName":"Jia-Jun","MiddleName":" ","LastName":"Ma","Suffix":" ","MasterCustomerId":"MXJJXA","MRAuthorId":1082964,"Email":"hoxide@xmu.edu.cn","CustomerSequence":0,"Affiliation":"School of Mathematical Sciences, Xiamen University, Xiamen 361005, People\u0026rsquo;s Republic of China; and Department of Mathematics, Xiamen University Malaysia Campus, Sepang, Selangor Darul Ehsan 43900, Malaysia","AffiliationSequence":0,"FirstEditor":false,"Url":null,"Description":null,"BookReviewId":0,"CurrentAddress":null},{"RelationshipType":"AUTHOR","FullName":"Binyong Sun","FirstName":"Binyong","MiddleName":" ","LastName":"Sun","Suffix":" ","MasterCustomerId":"SNBNXG","MRAuthorId":805605,"Email":"sunbinyong@zju.edu.cn","CustomerSequence":0,"Affiliation":"Institute for Advanced Study in Mathematics, Zhejiang University, Hangzhou 310058, People\u0026rsquo;s Republic of China; and New Cornerstone Science Laboratory, Zhejiang University, Hangzhou 310058, People\u0026rsquo;s Republic of China","AffiliationSequence":0,"FirstEditor":false,"Url":null,"Description":null,"BookReviewId":0,"CurrentAddress":null},{"RelationshipType":"AUTHOR","FullName":"Chen-Bo Zhu","FirstName":"Chen-Bo","MiddleName":" ","LastName":"Zhu","Suffix":" ","MasterCustomerId":"ZHCHXA","MRAuthorId":305157,"Email":"matzhucb@nus.edu.sg","CustomerSequence":0,"Affiliation":"Department of Mathematics, National University of Singapore, 10 Lower Kent Ridge Road, Singapore 119076","AffiliationSequence":0,"FirstEditor":false,"Url":null,"Description":null,"BookReviewId":0,"CurrentAddress":null}],"BookReviews":[],"AMSCopyrightFlag":"Y","CopyrightOwner":"American Mathematical Society","MRNumber":null,"ArticleCitation":"J. Amer. Math. Soc.","CrossReferences":"","Abstracts":[],"IsAMSCopyright":true,"PostDateFormatted":"September 21, 2026"},{"ArticleId":93354,"JournalProductCode":"JAMS","IssueId":null,"ManuscriptId":1084,"DocumentType":"ARTICLE","Title":"Improved bounds for the two-point logarithmic Chowla conjecture","DOI":"10.1090/jams/1084","PII":"S0894-0347-2026-01084-3","Issue":null,"IssueDirectory":"0000-000-00","StartPage":null,"EndPage":null,"PostDate":"2026-09-10T00:00:00","PrimaryMsc":"11N37, 05C48","SecondaryMsc":"11N56, 11N36","MscSchema":"2020","Abstract":"Let $\\lambda$ be the Liouville function, defined as $\\lambda (n) \u0026#x2254;(-1)^{\\Omega (n)}$ where $\\Omega (n)$ is the number of prime factors of $n$ with multiplicity. In 2021, Helfgott and Radziwi\u0026#x142;\u0026#x142; proved that \\begin{equation*} \\sum _{n\\leqslant x} \\frac {1}{n}\\lambda (n) \\lambda (n\u002B1) \\ll \\frac {\\log x}{(\\log \\log x)^{1/2}}, \\end{equation*} improving earlier results by Tao and Ter\u0026auml;v\u0026auml;inen. We prove that \\begin{equation*} \\sum _{n\\leqslant x} \\frac 1n \\lambda (n) \\lambda (n\u002B1) \\ll (\\log x)^{1-c} \\end{equation*} for some absolute constant $c\u0026gt;0$. This appears to be best possible with current methods.","EnhancedReferences":"\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Bass%2C%20Hyman\u0022\u003EHyman Bass\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Cem\u003EThe Ihara-Selberg zeta function of a tree lattice\u003C/em\u003E, Internat. J. Math. \u003Cstrong\u003E3\u003