r Journal of the AMS (Paper and Electronic)","Alt2ImageAltText":"Journal of the AMS (Paper and Electronic)","Imprint":"","PublisherText":null,"CooperationText":null,"OutOfStockReason":"","NextReceiptDate":"1900-01-01T00:00:00","AdditionalAuthorText":null,"Distribution":null,"SeriesDistribution":"","AdditionalSeriesText":"","RelatedCustomers":[],"AddToCartItems":[],"TOCItems":[],"ReviewItems":[],"AwardItems":[],"RevisionItems":[],"FileItems":[],"CrossSellProducts":[],"SetProducts":[],"IncludedInSets":[],"AllowCopyrightPermissionFlag":"false","EpubISBN":"","GetPermissionsItems":[],"ProductOptions":[],"PointsEligibleFlag":"Y","ProductMedia":[{"LargeImage":"https://ebus.ams.org/ProductImages/jams-cov-graphic.jpg","SmallImage":"https://ebus.ams.org/ProductImages/sm-jams-cov-graphic.jpg","MediaFileType":"IMAGE","AltText":"Journal of the AMS (Paper and Electronic)","FullUrl":"","Sort":1,"YoutubeId":""}],"InstructorsManualFlag":"N","InstructorsSolutionManualFlag":null,"ProductText":[{"TextTypeCode":"TEXT","Text":"\u003Cdiv\u003EThe Journal of the American Mathematical Society publishes articles of exceptional quality and broad interest in all areas of mathematics. We seek articles distinguished not only by the importance of their results but also by the originality of the ideas behind them. We especially welcome papers that open new directions for research and that mathematicians want to read and discuss. \u003Cbr/\u003E\u003Cbr/\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\r\n\u003Cdiv\u003EPublished quarterly since 1988, the Journal is recognized for high impact and uniquely rigorous peer review. \u003Cbr/\u003E\u003Cbr/\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\r\n\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cspan id=\u0022issn\u0022\u003EISSN 1088-6834 (online) ISSN 0894-0347 (print)\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cbr/\u003E\u003Cbr/\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\r\n\u003Cdiv\u003EThe 2024 MCQ for Journal of the American Mathematical Society is \u003Cspan class=\u0022productDetailMCQ\u0022\u003E4.83\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ci class=\u0022fa-solid fa-circle-info\u0022 data-bs-toggle=\u0022popover\u0022 data-bs-html=\u0022true\u0022 data-bs-trigger=\u0022focus\u0022 title=\u0022What is MCQ?\u0022\r\n  data-bs-content=\u0022The Mathematical Citation Quotient (MCQ) measures journal impact by looking at citations over a five-year period. \u003Ca href=\u0027https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/journal/profile?groupId=3285\u0027 target=\u0027_blank\u0027\u003ESubscribers to MathSciNet\u003C/a\u003E may click through for more detailed information.\u0022\r\n  tabindex=\u00220\u0022 style=\u0022cursor:pointer;\u0022 \u003E\u003C/i\u003E\u003C/div\u003E","TextHtml":"\u003Cdiv\u003EThe Journal of the American Mathematical Society publishes articles of exceptional quality and broad interest in all areas of mathematics. We seek articles distinguished not only by the importance of their results but also by the originality of the ideas behind them. We especially welcome papers that open new directions for research and that mathematicians want to read and discuss. \u003Cbr/\u003E\u003Cbr/\u003E\u003C/div\u003E \u003Cdiv\u003EPublished quarterly since 1988, the Journal is recognized for high impact and uniquely rigorous peer review. \u003Cbr/\u003E\u003Cbr/\u003E\u003C/div\u003E \u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cspan id=\u0022issn\u0022\u003EISSN 1088-6834 (online) ISSN 0894-0347 (print)\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cbr/\u003E\u003Cbr/\u003E\u003C/div\u003E \u003Cdiv\u003EThe 2024 MCQ for Journal of the American Mathematical Society is \u003Cspan class=\u0022productDetailMCQ\u0022\u003E4.83\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ci class=\u0022fa-solid fa-circle-info\u0022 data-bs-toggle=\u0022popover\u0022 data-bs-html=\u0022true\u0022 data-bs-trigger=\u0022focus\u0022 title=\u0022What is MCQ?\u0022    data-bs-content=\u0022The Mathematical Citation Quotient (MCQ) measures journal impact by looking at citations over a five-year period. \u003Ca href=\u0027https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/journal/profile?groupId=3285\u0027 target=\u0027_blank\u0027\u003ESubscribers to MathSciNet\u003C/a\u003E may click through for more detailed information.\u0022 tabindex=\u00220\u0022 style=\u0022cursor:pointer;\u0022 \u003E\u003C/i\u003E\u003C/div\u003E","SourceHtml":"","SeqNo":0}],"AllowDeskExamCopyRequest":"N","EstimatedPagesFlag":null,"AddToCartFlag":null,"DisplayAuthorEditorFlag":null,"AMSPublication":null,"ShowMareNostrumLinkFlag":null};
