-07968-4\u0022\u003E10.1007/978-3-319-07968-4\u003C/a\u003E \u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","BibliographicInfo":"\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGustavo Jasso\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EAffiliation: Lund University, Centre for Mathematical Sciences, S\u0026ouml;lvegatan 18A, 221 00 Lund, Sweden\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EAddress at time of publication: Mathematisches Institut, Universit\u0026auml;t zu K\u0026ouml;ln, Weyertal 86-90, 50931 K\u0026ouml;ln, Germany\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EMR Author ID: \u003Ca href=\u0027https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?mrauthid=1019284\u0027\u003E1019284\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EEmail: gjasso@math.uni-koeln.de\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFernando Muro\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EAffiliation: Universidad de Sevilla, Calle Tarfia s/n, 41012 Sevilla, Spain\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EMR Author ID: \u003Ca href=\u0027https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?mrauthid=724223\u0027\u003E724223\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EEmail: fmuro@us.es\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBernhard Keller\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EAffiliation: Universit\u0026eacute; Paris Cit\u0026eacute;, UFR de Math\u0026eacute;matiques, Case 7012, B\u0026acirc;timent Sophie Germain, 8 place Aur\u0026eacute;lie Nemours, 75013 Paris Cedex 13, France\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EMR Author ID: \u003Ca href=\u0027https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?mrauthid=99940\u0027\u003E99940\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EORCID: \u003Ca href=\u0027https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4493-2040\u0027\u003E0000-0002-4493-2040\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EEmail: bernhard.keller@imj-prg.fr\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EReceived by editor(s): August 25, 2023\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EReceived by editor(s) in revised form: January 25,