018\u0022\u003E10.1016/j.aim.2012.04.018\u003C/a\u003E \u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E Toshiyuki Tanisaki, \u003Cem\u003EDifferential operators on quantized flag manifolds at roots of unity, II\u003C/em\u003E, Nagoya Math. J. \u003Cstrong\u003E214\u003C/strong\u003E (2014), 1\u0026ndash;52. \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=3211817\u0022\u003EMR \u003Cstrong\u003E3211817\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/a\u003E, DOI \u003Ca href=\u0022https://doi.org/10.1215/00277630-2402198\u0022\u003E10.1215/00277630-2402198\u003C/a\u003E \u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E Toshiyuki Tanisaki, \u003Cem\u003EThe center of a quantized enveloping algebra at an even root of unity\u003C/em\u003E, Osaka J. Math. \u003Cstrong\u003E53\u003C/strong\u003E (2016), no. 1, 47\u0026ndash;81. \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=3466826\u0022\u003EMR \u003Cstrong\u003E3466826\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/a\u003E \u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E Toshiyuki Tanisaki, \u003Cem\u003EAffine open covering of the quantized flag manifolds at roots of unity\u003C/em\u003E, J. Algebra \u003Cstrong\u003E586\u003C/strong\u003E (2021), 62\u0026ndash;98. \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=4284996\u0022\u003EMR \u003Cstrong\u003E4284996\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/a\u003E, DOI \u003Ca href=\u0022https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jalgebra.2021.06.014\u0022\u003E10.1016/j.jalgebra.2021.06.014\u003C/a\u003E \u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E Toshiyuki Tanisaki, \u003Cem\u003EDifferential operators on quantized flag manifolds at roots of unity III\u003C/em\u003E, Adv. Math. \u003Cstrong\u003E392\u003C/strong\u003E (2021), Paper No. 107990, 51. \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=4312858\u0022\u003EMR \u003Cstrong\u003E4312858\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/a\u003E, DOI \u003Ca href=\u0022https://doi.org/10.1016/j.aim.2021.107990\u0022\u003E10.1016/j.aim.2021.107990\u003C/a\u003E \u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E Toshiyuki Tan