.  \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=22177\u0022\u003EMR \u003Cstrong\u003E22177\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Bohm%2C%20David\u0022\u003EDavid Bohm\u003C/a\u003E and \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Pines%2C%20David\u0022\u003EDavid Pines\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Cem\u003EA collective description of electron interactions. I. Magnetic interactions\u003C/em\u003E, Phys. Rev. (2) \u003Cstrong\u003E82\u003C/strong\u003E (1951), 625\u0026ndash;634.  \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=41712\u0022\u003EMR \u003Cstrong\u003E41712\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/a\u003E, DOI \u003Ca href=\u0022https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRev.82.625\u0022\u003E10.1103/PhysRev.82.625\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Bohm%2C%20David\u0022\u003EDavid Bohm\u003C/a\u003E and \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Pines%2C%20David\u0022\u003EDavid Pines\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Cem\u003EA collective description of electron interactions. II. Collective vs individual particle aspects of the interactions\u003C/em\u003E, Phys. Rev. (2) \u003Cstrong\u003E85\u003C/strong\u003E (1952), 338\u0026ndash;353.  \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=102331\u0022\u003EMR \u003Cstrong\u003E102331\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/a\u003E, DOI \u003Ca href=\u0022https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRev.85.338\u0022\u003E10.1103/PhysRev.85.338\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Bohm%2C%20David\u0022\u003EDavid Bohm\u003C/a\u003E and \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Pines%2C%