<div class='productDetailSubscriptionTabHeader'>Articles in press</div><div class='productDetailSubscriptionTabSubheader'><div>Papers are displayed alphabetically by first author listed<br>Early View PDF articles are an AMS member benefit</div></div>    <div class="productDetailSubscriptionTabInfo"><ul><li id='articleContent_92486' data-ams-pii='jams1083'><div class='productDetailTitle'>Singular Hodge theory for combinatorial geometries</div><div><a href='https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/authors-search?query=Braden%2C%20Tom' target='_blank'>Tom Braden</a>, <a href='https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/authors-search?query=Huh%2C%20June' target='_blank'>June Huh</a>, <a href='https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/authors-search?query=Matherne%2C%20Jacob' target='_blank'>Jacob P. Matherne</a>, <a href='https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/authors-search?query=Proudfoot%2C%20Nicholas' target='_blank'>Nicholas Proudfoot</a> and <a href='https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/authors-search?query=Wang%2C%20Botong' target='_blank'>Botong Wang</a></div><div>Primary MSC: 05B35; Secondary MSC: 05B35</div><div>J. Amer. Math. Soc.</div><div>DOI: https://doi.org/10.1090/jams/1083</div><div class='productDetailFileLinkContainer right'><div class='productDetailFileLinkWrapper'><a class='productDetailBtn productDetailDownloadPdfButton' target='_blank' onclick='return addTimestampToHref(event, this)' href='https://www.ams.org/journals/jams/earlyview/jams1083/jams1083.pdf'>PDF</a></div></div><li id='articleContent_92919' data-ams-pii='jams1086'><div class='productDetailTitle'>Integrability of conformal loop ensemble: Imaginary DOZZ formula and beyond</div><div><a href='https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/authors-search?query=Ang%2C%20Morris' target='_blank'>Morris Ang</a>, <a href='https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/authors-search?query=Cai%2C%20Gefei' target='_blank'>Gefei Cai</a>, <a href='https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/authors-search?query=Sun%2C%20Xin' target='