            <div>HTML articles powered by AMS MathViewer <a href="https://www.ams.org/AMSMathViewer" target="_blank" aria-label="open new tab with math viewer info"><i class="fa fa-info-circle" aria-label="about MathViewer" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></div>
