<li><a href="https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Hua%2C%20Loo%20Keng">Loo Keng Hua</a>, <em>Introduction to number theory</em>, Springer-Verlag, Berlin-New York, 1982. Translated from the Chinese by Peter Shiu.  <a href="https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=665428">MR <strong>665428</strong></a></li>


<li><a href="https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Kannan%2C%20Ravindran">Ravindran Kannan</a> and <a href="https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Bachem%2C%20Achim">Achim Bachem</a>, <em>Polynomial algorithms for computing the Smith and Hermite normal forms of an integer matrix</em>, SIAM J. Comput. <strong>8</strong> (1979), no. 4, 499–507.  <a href="https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=573842">MR <strong>573842</strong></a>, DOI <a href="https://doi.org/10.1137/0208040">10.1137/0208040</a></li>


